        "Any indicators of compromise or observations you want security to consider"
      ],
      "timeline_and_communication": "We will initiate the escalation once you confirm. Sanitized findings will be provided within 1–2 business days after Security completes its review, with regular updates as appropriate. If you prefer, we can also arrange a live bridge call with leadership and Security to discuss findings and next steps."
    },
    "next_steps_options": [
      "Please confirm whether you would like us to proceed with Security escalation now.",
      "Provide the scope details and security contact information requested above to expedite handoff.",
      "If desired, we can schedule a real-time bridge call with leadership and Security."
    ],
    "data_handling_commitment": "We will share only sanitized data and findings with leadership. Raw logs and credential dumps will not be exposed externally, and any data disclosures will follow security governance approvals."
  }
}

